From c83fececa26c840879393b4c0e3437decbd3c01b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Work Leaf Bench <bench@example.com>
Date: Tue, 15 Sep 2026 06:26:04 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] ADD selected-agent slash routing so backend commands
 bypass command chat parsing

WorkLeafController classifies slash-prefixed non-whitespace lines as backend-agent chat when an agent is selected, while preserving command-surface parsing when no agent is selected. The terminal app and harness route command-mode and prompt-mode slash input through the same selected-agent path so commands such as /status reach the active backend session unchanged.
